  'DW, in its round-up of the overnight and morning attack, writes, citing the Kyiv regional prosecutor\'s office, that three people were killed when a drone attacked the village of Chabany near the Kyiv–Odesa highway and four more were injured. In addition, in Obukhiv district of the same region a man and two women were killed and six people injured when a production and warehouse building was hit.'))

